{
  "snp3.11:0.1": "",
  "snp3.11:0.2": "",
  "snp3.11:1.1": "Ānandajāte tidasagaṇe patīte ",
  "snp3.11:1.2": "sakkacca Indaṃ sucivasane ca deve ",
  "snp3.11:1.3": "dussaṃ gahetvā atiriva thomayante ",
  "snp3.11:1.4": "Asito isi addasa divāvihāre. 680. ",
  "snp3.11:2.1": "Disvāna deve muditamane udagge ",
  "snp3.11:2.2": "cittiṃkaritvā idam avocāsi tattha: ",
  "snp3.11:2.3": "\"kiṃ devasaṃgho atiriva kalyarīpo, ",
  "snp3.11:2.4": "dussaṃ gahetvā bhamayatha kiṃ paṭicca. 681. ",
  "snp3.11:3.1": "Yadā pi āsi asurehi saṅgamo, ",
  "snp3.11:3.2": "jayo surānaṃ asurā parājitā, ",
  "snp3.11:3.3": "tadā pi n' etādiso lomahaṃsano: ",
  "snp3.11:3.4": "kim abbhutaṃ daṭṭhu marū pamoditā. 682. ",
  "snp3.11:4.1": "Seḷenti gāyanti ca vādayanti ca ",
  "snp3.11:4.2": "bhujāni poṭhenti ca naccayanti ca, -- ",
  "snp3.11:4.3": "",
  "snp3.11:4.4": "dhunātha me saṃsayaṃ khippa mārisā\". 683. ",
  "snp3.11:5.1": "\"So Bodhisatto ratanavaro atulyo ",
  "snp3.11:5.2": "manussaloke hitasukhatāya jāto ",
  "snp3.11:5.3": "Sakyānaṃ gāme janapade Lumbineyye, ",
  "snp3.11:5.4": "ten' amha tuṭṭhā atiriva kalyarūpā. 684. ",
  "snp3.11:6.1": "So sabbasattutamo aggapuggalo ",
  "snp3.11:6.2": "narāsabho sabbapajānaṃ uttamo| ",
  "snp3.11:6.3": "vattessati cakkaṃ Isivhaye vane ",
  "snp3.11:6.4": "nadaṃ va sīho balavā migādhibhū\". 685. ",
  "snp3.11:7.1": "Taṃ saddaṃ sutvā turitam avaṃsarī so, ",
  "snp3.11:7.2": "Suddhodanassa tada bhavanaṃ upāgami, ",
  "snp3.11:7.3": "nisajja tattha idam avocāsi Sakye: ",
  "snp3.11:7.4": "\"kuhiṃ kumāro, aham api daṭṭhukāmo\". 686. ",
  "snp3.11:8.1": "Tato kumāraṃ jalitam iva suvaṇṇaṃ ",
  "snp3.11:8.2": "ukkāmukhe va sukusalasampahaṭṭhaṃ ",
  "snp3.11:8.3": "daddallamānaṃ suriyā anomavaṇṇaṃ ",
  "snp3.11:8.4": "dassesu puttaṃ Asitavhayassa Sakyā. 687. ",
  "snp3.11:9.1": "Disvā kumāraṃ sikhim iva pajjalantaṃ ",
  "snp3.11:9.2": "tārāsabhaṃ va nabhasigamaṃ visuddhaṃ ",
  "snp3.11:9.3": "suriyan tapantaṃ sarada-r-iv' abbhamuttaṃ ",
  "snp3.11:9.4": "ānandajāto vipulam alattha pītiṃ. 688. ",
  "snp3.11:10.1": "Anekasākhañ ca sahassamaṇḍalaṃ ",
  "snp3.11:10.2": "chattaṃ marū dhārayum antalikkhe, ",
  "snp3.11:10.3": "sucaṇṇadaṇḍā vītipatanti cāmarā, ",
  "snp3.11:10.4": "na dissare cāmarachattagāhakā. 689. ",
  "snp3.11:11.1": "Disvā jaṭi Kaṇhasirivhayo isi ",
  "snp3.11:11.2": "suvaṇṇanekkhaṃ viya paṇḍukambale ",
  "snp3.11:11.3": "setañ ca chattaṃ dhariyanta muddhani ",
  "snp3.11:11.4": "udaggacitto sumano paṭiggahe. 690. ",
  "snp3.11:12.1": "Paṭiggahetvā pana Sakyapuṅgavaṃ ",
  "snp3.11:12.2": "jigiṃsako lakkhaṇamantapāragū ",
  "snp3.11:12.3": "pasannacitto giram abbhudīrayi: ",
  "snp3.11:12.4": "\"anuttar' āyaṃ dipadānam uttamo\". 691. ",
  "snp3.11:13.1": "Ath' attano gamanam anussaranto ",
  "snp3.11:13.2": "akalyarūpo galayati assukāni, ",
  "snp3.11:13.3": "disvāna Sakyā isim avocuṃ rudantaṃ: ",
  "snp3.11:13.4": "\"no ce kumāre bhavissati antarāyo\". 692. ",
  "snp3.11:14.1": "Disvāna Sakye isi-m-avoca akalye: ",
  "snp3.11:14.2": "\"nāhaṃ kumāre ahitam anussarāmi, ",
  "snp3.11:14.3": "na cāpi-m-assa bhavissati antarāyo, ",
  "snp3.11:14.4": "na orak' āyaṃ, adhimanasā bhavātha. 693. ",
  "snp3.11:15.1": "Sambodhiyaggaṃ phusissat' āyaṃ kumāro, ",
  "snp3.11:15.2": "so dhammacakkaṃ paramavisuddhadassī ",
  "snp3.11:15.3": "vattessat' āyaṃ bahujanahitānukampī, ",
  "snp3.11:15.4": "vitthārik' assa bhavissati brahmacariyaṃ. 694. ",
  "snp3.11:16.1": "Mamañ ca āyu na ciram idhāvaseso, ",
  "snp3.11:16.2": "ath' antarā me bhavissati kālakiriyā, ",
  "snp3.11:16.3": "so 'haṃ na sussaṃ asamadhurassa dhammaṃ, ",
  "snp3.11:16.4": "ten' amhi aṭṭo vyasanagato aghāvī\". 695. ",
  "snp3.11:17.1": "So Sākiyānaṃ vipulaṃ janetva pūtiṃ ",
  "snp3.11:17.2": "antepuramhā niragama brahmacārī. -- ",
  "snp3.11:17.3": "So bhāgineyyaṃ sayam anukampamāno ",
  "snp3.11:17.4": "samādapesi asamadhurassa dhamme: 696. ",
  "snp3.11:18.1": "\"‘Buddho' ti ghosaṃ yada parato suṇāsi ",
  "snp3.11:18.2": "‘sambodhipatto vicarati dhammamaggaṃ,' ",
  "snp3.11:18.3": "",
  "snp3.11:18.4": "carassu tasmiṃ Bhagavati brahmacariyaṃ\". 697. ",
  "snp3.11:19.1": "Tenānusiṭṭho hitamanasena tādinā ",
  "snp3.11:19.2": "anāgate paramavisuddhadassinā ",
  "snp3.11:19.3": "so Nālako upacitapuññasañcayo ",
  "snp3.11:19.4": "Jinaṃ patikkhaṃ parivasi rakkhitindriyo. 698. ",
  "snp3.11:20.1": "Sutvāna ghosaṃ Jinavaracakkavattane ",
  "snp3.11:20.2": "gantvāna disvā isinisabhaṃ pasanno| ",
  "snp3.11:20.3": "",
  "snp3.11:20.4": "samāgate Asitavhayassa sāsane ti ",
  "snp3.11:20.5": "Vatthugāthā niṭṭhitā. 699. ",
  "snp3.11:21.1": "\"Aññātam etaṃ vacanaṃ ",
  "snp3.11:21.2": "Asitassa yathātathaṃ, ",
  "snp3.11:21.3": "taṃ taṃ Gotama pucchāma ",
  "snp3.11:21.4": "sabbadhammāna pāraguṃ: 700. ",
  "snp3.11:22.1": "Anagāriy' upetassa ",
  "snp3.11:22.2": "bhikkhācariyaṃ jigiṃsato ",
  "snp3.11:22.3": "muni pabrūhi me puṭṭho ",
  "snp3.11:22.4": "moneyyaṃ uttamaṃ padaṃ\". 701. ",
  "snp3.11:23.1": "\"Moneyyan te upaññissan ",
  "snp3.11:23.2": "ti Bhagavā ",
  "snp3.11:23.3": "dukkaraṃ durabhisambhavaṃ, ",
  "snp3.11:23.4": "handa te naṃ pavakkhāmi, ",
  "snp3.11:23.5": "santhambhassu daḷho bhava. 702. ",
  "snp3.11:24.1": "Samānabhāvaṃ kubbetha ",
  "snp3.11:24.2": "gāme akkuṭṭhavanditaṃ, ",
  "snp3.11:24.3": "manopadosaṃ rakkheyya , ",
  "snp3.11:24.4": "santo anuṇṇato care. 703. ",
  "snp3.11:25.1": "Uccāvacā niccharanti ",
  "snp3.11:25.2": "dāye aggisikhūpamā ",
  "snp3.11:25.3": "nariyo muniṃ palobhenti, ",
  "snp3.11:25.4": "tā su taṃ mā palobhayuṃ. 704. ",
  "snp3.11:26.1": "Virato methunā dhammā ",
  "snp3.11:26.2": "hitvā kāme parovare ",
  "snp3.11:26.3": "aviruddho asāratto ",
  "snp3.11:26.4": "pāṇesu tasathāvare, 705. ",
  "snp3.11:27.1": "‘yathā ahaṃ tathā ete, ",
  "snp3.11:27.2": "yathā ete tathā ahaṃ,' ",
  "snp3.11:27.3": "attānaṃ upamaṃ katvā ",
  "snp3.11:27.4": "na haneyya na ghātaye. 706. ",
  "snp3.11:28.1": "Hitvā icchañ ca lobhañ ca, ",
  "snp3.11:28.2": "yattha satto puthujjano, ",
  "snp3.11:28.3": "cakkhumā paṭipajjeyya , ",
  "snp3.11:28.4": "tareyya narakaṃ imaṃ. 707. ",
  "snp3.11:29.1": "Ūnūdaro mitāhāro ",
  "snp3.11:29.2": "appicch' assa alolupo, ",
  "snp3.11:29.3": "sa ve icchāya nicchāto ",
  "snp3.11:29.4": "aniccho hoti nibbuto. 708. ",
  "snp3.11:30.1": "Sa piṇḍacāraṃ caritvā ",
  "snp3.11:30.2": "vanantam abhihāraye ",
  "snp3.11:30.3": "upaṭṭhito rukkhamūlasmiṃ ",
  "snp3.11:30.4": "āsanūpagato muni. 709. ",
  "snp3.11:31.1": "Sa jhānapasuto dhīro ",
  "snp3.11:31.2": "vanante ramito siyā, ",
  "snp3.11:31.3": "jhāyetha rukkhamūlasmiṃ ",
  "snp3.11:31.4": "attānam abhitosayaṃ. 710. ",
  "snp3.11:32.1": "Tato ratyā vivasane ",
  "snp3.11:32.2": "gāmantam abhihāraye, ",
  "snp3.11:32.3": "avhānaṃ nābhinandeyya ",
  "snp3.11:32.4": "abhihārañ ca gāmato. 711. ",
  "snp3.11:33.1": "Na munī gāmam āgamma ",
  "snp3.11:33.2": "kulesu sahasā care ",
  "snp3.11:33.3": "ghāsesanaṃ chinnakatho, ",
  "snp3.11:33.4": "na vācam payutaṃ bhaṇe. 712. ",
  "snp3.11:34.1": "‘Alatthaṃ yad, idaṃ sādhu, ",
  "snp3.11:34.2": "nālatthaṃ, kusalām' iti ",
  "snp3.11:34.3": "ubhayen' eva so tādī ",
  "snp3.11:34.4": "rukkhaṃ va upanivattati. 713. ",
  "snp3.11:35.1": "Sa pattapāṇī vicaranto ",
  "snp3.11:35.2": "amūgo mūgasammato ",
  "snp3.11:35.3": "appaṃ dānaṃ na hīḷeyya, ",
  "snp3.11:35.4": "dātāraṃ nāvajāniya. 714. ",
  "snp3.11:36.1": "Uccāvacā hi paṭipadā ",
  "snp3.11:36.2": "samaṇena pakāsitā: ",
  "snp3.11:36.3": "na pāraṃ diguṇaṃ yanti, ",
  "snp3.11:36.4": "na idaṃ ekaguṇaṃ mutaṃ. 715. ",
  "snp3.11:37.1": "Yassa ca visatā n' atthi ",
  "snp3.11:37.2": "chinnasotassa bhikkhuno, ",
  "snp3.11:37.3": "kiccākiccappahīnassa ",
  "snp3.11:37.4": "pariḷāho na vijjati. 716. ",
  "snp3.11:38.1": "Moneyyan te upaññissan: ti Bhagavā ",
  "snp3.11:38.2": "khuradhārūpamo bhave, ",
  "snp3.11:38.3": "jivhāya tāluṃ āhacca ",
  "snp3.11:38.4": "udare saññato siyā, 717. ",
  "snp3.11:39.1": "alānacitto ca siyā, ",
  "snp3.11:39.2": "na cāpi bahu cintaye, ",
  "snp3.11:39.3": "nirāmagandho asito ",
  "snp3.11:39.4": "brahmacariyaparāyano. 718. ",
  "snp3.11:40.1": "Ekāsanassa sikkhetha ",
  "snp3.11:40.2": "samaṇopāsanassa ca, ",
  "snp3.11:40.3": "ekattaṃ monam akkhātaṃ, ",
  "snp3.11:40.4": "eko ce abhiramissati, 719. ",
  "snp3.11:40.5": "atha bhāsihi dasa disā. ",
  "snp3.11:41.1": "Sutvā dhīrānaṃ nigghosaṃ ",
  "snp3.11:41.2": "jhāyīnaṃ kāmacāginaṃ ",
  "snp3.11:41.3": "tato hiriñ ca saddhañ ca ",
  "snp3.11:41.4": "bhiyyo kubbetha māmako. 720. ",
  "snp3.11:42.1": "Tan nadīhi vijānātha ",
  "snp3.11:42.2": "sobbhesu padaresu ca: ",
  "snp3.11:42.3": "saṇantā yanti kussobbhā, ",
  "snp3.11:42.4": "tuṇhī yāti mahodadhi. 721. ",
  "snp3.11:43.1": "Yad ūnakaṃ, taṃ saṇati, ",
  "snp3.11:43.2": "yaṃ pūraṃ, santam eva taṃ: ",
  "snp3.11:43.3": "aḍḍhakumbhūpamo bālo, ",
  "snp3.11:43.4": "rahado pūro va paṇḍito. 722. ",
  "snp3.11:44.1": "Yaṃ samaṇo bahu bhāsati ",
  "snp3.11:44.2": "upetaṃ atthasaṃhitaṃ ",
  "snp3.11:44.3": "jānaṃ so dhammaṃ deseti, ",
  "snp3.11:44.4": "jānaṃ so bahu bhāsati. 723. ",
  "snp3.11:45.1": "Yo ca jānaṃ yatatto, ",
  "snp3.11:45.2": "jānaṃ na bahu bhāsati, ",
  "snp3.11:45.3": "sa munī monam arahati, ",
  "snp3.11:45.4": "sa munī monam ajjhagā\" ti NALAKASUTTAṂ NIṬṬHITAṂ. 12. Dvayatānupassanāsutta. ",
  "snp3.11:45.5": ""
}
